### seteo el puerto segun puerto https de launchSettings.json
@AuthServer_HostAddress = https://localhost:7095

### 1) Credenciales correctas -> 200 con access_token
POST {{AuthServer_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=booking-business&client_secret={{SecretoBooking}}

### 2) Secreto incorrecto -> 401
POST {{AuthServer_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=booking-business&client_secret=cualquiera

### 3) Tipo de acceso no soportado -> 400
POST {{AuthServer_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password